### Cash payment (needs a FIRED/PREPARING/READY order and a SERVER/MANAGER/ADMIN token from /api/auth)
# Reuse the same Idempotency-Key when retrying the same attempt; a new attempt gets a new UUID.
POST http://localhost:8090/api/orders/{{orderId}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: 6f1c2b8e-0d4a-4c1e-9a77-2b5d0e9c1a01
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "method": "CASH",
  "amount": 21.00,
  "tip": 3.00,
  "tendered": 30.00
}
